  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Keep every stem in the form Add [suffix] to [base], or <NAME> will add [suffix] to the word [base].",
      "Use only roots.txt words, allowed_extra_words, and <NAME>. No plus signs.",
      "Offer four unique whole-word spellings. One right drop-e form. Tap only.",
      "Always include the keep-e misspelling, such as bakeing, decideing, or tastey.",
      "Other distractors may double a consonant or change one vowel, but must still look like the same word.",
      "Never use a different real word as a distractor, such as latter for later.",
      "Tier 1 bases are short silent-e words: bake, make, name, smile, ride, wave.",
      "Tier 2 uses -er, -est, or -y on grade-level bases: late, nice, ripe, taste, shine, come.",
      "Tier 3 uses two-syllable bases: decide, complete, create, become. Near-miss spellings only.",
      "Kid world only: school, home, food, pets, play, family, weather. No brands. No real names."
    ]
  },
